{"type":"turn_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Great! Now I understand the schemas:\n\nFarmers markets:\n- state_name\n- state_abbr\n- farmers_markets (int64)\n- Other columns\n\nCensus population:\n- NAME (state name)\n- POPESTIMATE2025 (2025 population)\n\nI need to:\n1. Sum the farmers_markets column from the farmers_markets table, excluding territories\n2. Get the United States' 2025 population from census_population (NAME = 'United States')\n3. Calculate (farmers_markets / population) * 100,000\n\nLet me first check a few rows from each table to understand the data better, then get the total farmers markets (excluding territories).\n\nUS states are typically: AL, AK, AZ, AR, CA, CO, CT, DE, FL, GA, HI, ID, IL, IN, IA, KS, KY, LA, ME, MD, MA, MI, MN, MS, MO, MT, NE, NV, NH, NJ, NM, NY, NC, ND, OH, OK, OR, PA, RI, SC, SD, TN, TX, UT, VT, VA, WA, WV, WI, WY (50 states)\n\nTerritories might be: PR (Puerto Rico), VI (Virgin Islands), GU (Guam), AS (American Samoa), MP (Northern Mariana Islands)\n\nLet me peek at the farmers markets data to see what's there.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Now let me examine the data to understand what constitutes territories:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01EmNkKtKk7tAnYpLLZ7LtNB","name":"xorq_select","arguments":{"catalog_path":".xorq/catalog","on":"farmers_markets","compose":"source.limit(60)","limit":0}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-haiku-4-5","usage":{"input":14,"output":478,"cacheRead":17521,"cacheWrite":1460,"totalTokens":19473,"cost":{"input":0.000014,"output":0.00239,"cacheRead":0.0017521000000000001,"cacheWrite":0.001825,"total":0.0059811000000000005},"cacheWrite1h":0,"reasoning":342},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786911699807,"responseId":"msg_011Ce73qGfpsJNu3YvbuQVjC","rawStopReason":"tool_use"},"toolResults":[{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01EmNkKtKk7tAnYpLLZ7LtNB","toolName":"xorq_select","content":[{"typ